  {
    "id": "event-2nggi657iu2j767866s0radv73@google.com",
    "category": "events",
    "timestamp": "2017-09-20T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "[Predictions] Woke up scared, weird dream",
    "detail": {
      "calendar": "Predictions",
      "summary": "Woke up scared, weird dream",
      "description": "<html-blob>In my dream I could fly just by thinking about it.  I was searching for something, and I saw the world like a Google map with lines in between every city.  The map was dark and the lines glowed red kind of like Cerebro.<br><br>Is this the key to astral-projection?  I dreamt I opened my eyes and saw Iga waving her hands like she was trying to escape her dream. When she woke up she told me had a nightmare about being burglarized.  Lilu started barking and Iga said she thought someone was there.  Maybe it was me returning to the bed?  Is my spirit unrecognizable?  If we recorded every dream would we be able to find some sort of link between us and the people in our dreams?<br><br>Empathy is the fabric that connects us all.  Is the whole point of business to improve someone else's life?  If that is true, then CEOs aren't narcissists they are empaths stuck in a world full of labels.<br><br></html-blob>",
      "location": "",
      "start": "2017-09-20T12:00:00.000Z",
      "end": "2017-09-20T13:00:00.000Z",
      "isPublic": true
    }
  },
